      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## IHL - Inbound Call Context\n\nVoice agent (SynthFlow) calls this webhook at call start with body.user_phone_number.\nWe look up the GHL contact by phone (Independent Lending location) and return\npersonalization variables: full name, Introduction line, Notes, Last Name, Email.\n\nMirror of 'Kingsmen (inbound call context)' but resolves custom fields BY ID\n(custom_introduction / lead_notes) instead of array position.\n\nSETUP: point the SynthFlow inbound webhook at this workflow's Production URL.\nAuth: HTTP node uses the 'Independent Lending' Bearer credential (re-select if import breaks it).",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-ctx-0001",
      "name": "Sticky: Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
